<title>USA: Washington Cty SDBOE, Utah, won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Washington Cty SDBOE, Utah, won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc. said it won $19.540 million of Washington Cty SDBOE, Utah, general obligation refunding bonds, Series May 1, 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.84 percent.</p>
</text>
